       2100-ACCRUE-DAILY.
           MOVE ACCT-COLLECTED-BAL TO WS-PRINCIPAL.
           IF ACCT-STATUS-CD = 'DORM'
              MOVE ZERO TO WS-DAILY-ACCRUAL
              MOVE 'Y' TO WS-ACCRUAL-SUPPRESSED
              GO TO 2100-EXIT
           END-IF.
           COMPUTE WS-DAILY-ACCRUAL =
               (WS-PRINCIPAL * WS-DAILY-RATE) / 365.
       2100-EXIT.   EXIT.
